IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sga3-78d-78k`
IMPORT `sg-proc-capital-reduction`

-- Tests for sg-proc-capital-reduction.l4 (ss 78B to 78K: the procedure for a reduction of share capital).
-- Every expected outcome below was written from the text (src:9304-9885 of CoA1967.txt) before the module was run,
-- never copied from its output. A trace that does not match is a finding. Day 0 of each trace is the day the TIMELINE line above its rule names.
-- Counting used throughout (the keel's P10): the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date end on day 41 after it, the 8 weeks on day 55,
-- and "15 days beginning with" a date end on day 14 after it. The days of a trace are absolute from its day 0; a HENCE restarts the clock where the step before it was done.
-- Dates are 1 March 2026 plus the day of the trace where a rule takes a DATE input.

§ `The counting helpers`

#ASSERT `the days from the solvency statement to the latest resolution date it can serve` (Date 1 3 2026) 20 EQUALS 19
#ASSERT `the days from the solvency statement to the latest resolution date it can serve` (Date 1 3 2026) 30 EQUALS 29
#ASSERT `the days from the resolution date to the last day of the weeks beginning with it` (Date 1 3 2026) 6 EQUALS 41
#ASSERT `the days from the resolution date to the last day of the weeks beginning with it` (Date 1 3 2026) 8 EQUALS 55
#ASSERT `the days from the resolution date to the last day of the weeks beginning with it` (Date 31 1 2026) 6 EQUALS 41
#ASSERT `the days after its first day on which a period of days beginning with that day ends` 15 EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `the company need not meet the solvency requirements under s 78B(2) or s 78C(2)` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the company need not meet the solvency requirements under s 78B(2) or s 78C(2)` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT (NOT (`the company need not meet the solvency requirements under s 78B(2) or s 78C(2)` TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`the company need not meet the solvency requirements under s 78B(2) or s 78C(2)` FALSE FALSE TRUE))

§ `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b): the statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks`

-- Arguments: the company; the company is a private company; the reduction involves cash or assets; it involves a release of a liability; the resolution date. Day 0 is the resolution date.
-- Two acts, as the existing rule has them: the statement is made available on day 0, and must not be withdrawn before the end of the 6 weeks (the last day is day 41).

-- Made available on day 0 and never withdrawn.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 0
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

-- Made available on day 0 and withdrawn on day 41, the last day of the 6 weeks: not available throughout them.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company withdraws the solvency statement from inspection by creditors before the end of the 6 weeks` AT 41

-- Made available on day 0 and withdrawn on day 10: an early withdrawal is not a report that the statement was kept open to day 41.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company withdraws the solvency statement from inspection by creditors before the end of the 6 weeks` AT 10

-- Made available on day 0 and withdrawn on day 42, after the 6 weeks: the text bars no withdrawal then.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company withdraws the solvency statement from inspection by creditors before the end of the 6 weeks` AT 42

-- Made available only on day 1: not available from the resolution date.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 1

-- The statement is never made available.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

-- A public company owes the same: s 78C(4)(b).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" FALSE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

-- Gate fails: the reduction involves no cash or assets and no release of a liability, so s 78B(2) dispenses with the solvency requirements and there is no statement to keep open.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company must keep the solvency statement open to creditors throughout the 6 weeks` "Acme Pte Ltd" TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

§ `s 78F(4) and (5): the notice of the Court's order`

-- Day 0 is the day the order is made.

-- The last day of the 15 days beginning with the date the order is made (day 14).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F(4) and (5) the company must send notice of the order to the Registrar within 15 days beginning with the date the order is made` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78F(4) the company sends notice of the order to the Registrar` AT 14

-- Day 15 is after the 15 days.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78F(4) and (5) the company must send notice of the order to the Registrar within 15 days beginning with the date the order is made` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78F(4) the company sends notice of the order to the Registrar` AT 15

-- No notice is sent.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78F(4) and (5) the company must send notice of the order to the Registrar within 15 days beginning with the date the order is made` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 30)

§ `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e): the lodging after the proceedings end`

-- Day 0 is the day the last proceedings are brought to an end.

-- The last day of the 15 days beginning with that date (day 14).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company must lodge within 15 days beginning with the date the last proceedings end` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 14

-- Day 15 is after the 15 days: the reduction does not take effect, which is no breach.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: a late lodging closes the route and the reduction does not take effect; the text states no offence for it (src:9618-9621)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company must lodge within 15 days beginning with the date the last proceedings end` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 15

§ `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws`

-- Arguments: the company; the creditor; the resolution has not been cancelled previously; the debt or claim is outstanding; the Court is satisfied the debt is unsecured and the applicant has no other safeguards; the Court is satisfied security is unnecessary; the creditor withdraws the application. Day 0 is the day the creditor applies.

-- The Court cancels on day 20 and the company sends the notice on day 34, the last of the 15 days beginning with day 20.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(2) the Court makes an order cancelling the resolution` AT 20
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78F(4) the company sends notice of the order to the Registrar` AT 34

-- The notice follows on day 35: one day after the 15 days.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(2) the Court makes an order cancelling the resolution` AT 20
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78F(4) the company sends notice of the order to the Registrar` AT 35

-- The Court has not decided: it has no time limit, so the duty is still open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- All the conditions of s 78F(2) are not met (the security is unnecessary): the Court is to dismiss, and the company lodges on day 24, the last day of the 15 days beginning with day 10.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 24

-- The company lodges on day 25: after the 15 days, so the reduction does not take effect.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: a late lodging closes the route and the reduction does not take effect; the text states no offence for it (src:9618-9621)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 25

-- Gate fails: the resolution had been cancelled previously, so s 78F(2) does not apply and the Court is to dismiss.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 24

-- The creditor withdraws on day 5 (proceedings end without determination) and the company lodges on day 19, the last day of the 15 days beginning with day 5.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78E(3)(d)(ii) and (4)(d)(ii) the creditor withdraws the application so that the proceedings end without determination` AT 5
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 19

-- The company lodges on day 20 after a withdrawal on day 5: after the 15 days, so the reduction does not take effect.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: a late lodging closes the route and the reduction does not take effect; the text states no offence for it (src:9618-9621)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78F and s 78E(3)(d): the Court decides, or the creditor withdraws` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78E(3)(d)(ii) and (4)(d)(ii) the creditor withdraws the application so that the proceedings end without determination` AT 5
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 20

§ `s 78D(4), s 78E(3), s 78F: after a creditor applies`

-- Day 0 is the day the creditor applies.
-- The last argument of every trace in this section is the found period the standard of time allows, 7 days: "as soon as possible" (s 78D(4)).

-- Service and notice to the Registrar, the Court cancels, the notice of the order in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(4), s 78E(3), s 78F: the service, the notice to the Registrar and the Court's decision after a creditor applies` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(4)(a) the creditor serves the application on the company` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78D(4)(b) the company gives the Registrar notice of the application` AT 2
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(2) the Court makes an order cancelling the resolution` AT 20
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78F(4) the company sends notice of the order to the Registrar` AT 34

-- Service and notice, the Court dismisses, the lodging in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(4), s 78E(3), s 78F: the service, the notice to the Registrar and the Court's decision after a creditor applies` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE 7 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(4)(a) the creditor serves the application on the company` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78D(4)(b) the company gives the Registrar notice of the application` AT 2
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 24

-- The creditor never serves the application: "as soon as possible" is found as 7 days, so the creditor is in breach on day 8 although the Court has dismissed and the company has lodged.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: the creditor's duty to serve "as soon as possible" runs out after the found period of 7 days and the text lays it on the creditor (src:9519-9520)
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78D(4), s 78E(3), s 78F: the service, the notice to the Registrar and the Court's decision after a creditor applies` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE 7 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78D(4)(b) the company gives the Registrar notice of the application` AT 2
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 24

-- The company never gives the Registrar notice of the application: the found period of 7 days runs out and the company is in breach.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: the company's duty to give notice "as soon as possible" runs out after the found period of 7 days and the text lays it on the company (src:9522-9523)
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78D(4), s 78E(3), s 78F: the service, the notice to the Registrar and the Court's decision after a creditor applies` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE 7 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(4)(a) the creditor serves the application on the company` AT 1
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 24

§ `s 78D and s 78E(1), (2): the creditors' 6 weeks and the lodging after them`

-- Arguments: the company; the creditor; the resolution date; the creditor is entitled to a debt or claim admissible in proof (s 78D(3)); then the four conditions of the Court's order; the creditor withdraws the application. Day 0 is the resolution date. The last argument of every trace in this section is the found period the standard of time allows, 7 days (s 78D(4)), and, where the rule takes it, the date of the application (the resolution date unless a person outside s 78D(3) applies).

-- No application: the company lodges on day 42, the first day after the 6 weeks.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 42

-- No application: the company lodges on day 55, the last day before the end of the 8 weeks.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 55

-- No application: the company lodges on day 56, after the 8 weeks, so the reduction does not take effect, which is no breach.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: a lodging outside the weeks 6 to 8 means the reduction does not take effect and the text states no offence (src:9541-9542)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 56

-- The company lodges on day 41, the last day of the 6 weeks: not after the end of 6 weeks, so the lodging does not count, none follows, and the reduction does not take effect, which is no breach.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: a lodging outside the weeks 6 to 8 means the reduction does not take effect and the text states no offence (src:9541-9542)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 41
    (WAITUNTIL 70)

-- A creditor applies on day 41, the last day of the 6 weeks; the Court dismisses on day 60; the company lodges on day 74.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 41
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(4)(a) the creditor serves the application on the company` AT 42
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78D(4)(b) the company gives the Registrar notice of the application` AT 43
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(3) the Court dismisses the application` AT 60
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(3)(e) and (4)(e) the company lodges the directors' statement, the copy of the Court's order and the notice containing the reduction information` AT 74

-- A creditor applies on the resolution date itself (day 0); the Court cancels; the company sends the notice.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 0
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(4)(a) the creditor serves the application on the company` AT 1
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78D(4)(b) the company gives the Registrar notice of the application` AT 1
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78F(2) the Court makes an order cancelling the resolution` AT 5
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78F(4) the company sends notice of the order to the Registrar` AT 19

-- A creditor applies on day 41 and nothing more happens: the creditor does not serve the application and the company does not notify the Registrar within the found period of 7 days, so both are in breach.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: the duties of s 78D(4)(a) and (b) "as soon as possible" run out after the found period of 7 days (src:9519-9523)
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 41
    (WAITUNTIL 100)

-- An application on day 42 is after the 6 weeks: it is not an application "during the 6 weeks", so the company lodges on day 50 as if none had been made.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 42
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 50

-- Gate fails: the applicant has no debt or claim admissible in proof (s 78D(3)), so the application is not one under s 78D(2); s 78E(1)(b) is still met and the company's lodging is still owed until day 55, which passes without it, so the reduction does not take effect, which is no breach.
-- EXPECT changed after independent review: the company's lodging is owed only until day 55 (src:9547-9549) and a missing lodging means the reduction does not take effect (src:9541-9542)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 11 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 100)

-- The same, and the company lodges on day 50.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 11 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 50

-- The same application on day 10, and day 55 has come with no lodging: the lodging is owed until day 55 (45 days after the application), so the duty is still open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 11 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 55)

-- The same, and day 56 has come with no lodging: the route is closed, and the reduction does not take effect.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 11 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 56)

-- The same, and the company lodges on day 56: after day 55, so the reduction does not take effect.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78D(2) and s 78E: a creditor may apply to the Court during the 6 weeks, and otherwise the company must lodge after them` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 11 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Creditor "A Creditor" DOES `s 78D(2) a creditor applies to the Court for the resolution to be cancelled` AT 10
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 56

§ `s 186(1) and (3), s 78E(1)(c): the copy of the special resolution`

-- Day 0 is the day the resolution is passed. "within 14 days after the passing": the last day is day 14.

-- The copy is lodged on day 14.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 186(1) and (3), s 78E(1)(c) the company must lodge a copy of the special resolution within 14 days after the passing` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
