§ `s 78B and s 78C: the solvency statement, then the special resolution`

-- Arguments: the company; the creditor; the company is a private company; the reduction involves cash or assets; it involves a release; the date of the solvency statement (day 0); the resolution date (the day the resolution is passed); the creditor is entitled (s 78D(3)); the four conditions of the Court's order; the creditor withdraws the application. Day 0 is the day all the directors make the statement: 1 March 2026. The last argument of every trace in this section is the found period the standard of time allows, 7 days (s 78D(4)), and, where the rule takes it, the date of the application (the resolution date unless a person outside s 78D(3) applies).

-- A private company: statement on day 0, resolution on day 19 (the last day of the period of 20 days beginning with the statement), the statement at the meeting on day 19, kept open to day 60, lodged on day 70.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B and s 78C: the solvency statement, the special resolution, and what the company owes from the resolution date` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 20 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(3)(a) and s 78C(3)(a) all the directors make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(1) and s 78C(1) the company passes the special resolution reducing its share capital` AT 19
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(a) and s 78C(4)(a) the company makes the solvency statement available to the members at the meeting, or serves it with every copy of the resolution` AT 19
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 19
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 186(1) and s 78E(1)(c) the company lodges a copy of the special resolution with the Registrar` AT 33
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 70

-- The resolution on day 20 is after the 20 days: the statement was made before the beginning of the period of 20 days ending with the resolution date, so the company does not meet the solvency requirements and nothing is owed under this route.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 78B and s 78C: the solvency statement, the special resolution, and what the company owes from the resolution date` "Acme Pte Ltd" "A Creditor" TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 21 3 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 7 (Date 21 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(3)(a) and s 78C(3)(a) all the directors make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction` AT 0
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(1) and s 78C(1) the company passes the special resolution reducing its share capital` AT 20

