    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(1) and s 78C(1) the company passes the special resolution reducing its share capital` AT 29
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(a) and s 78C(4)(a) the company makes the solvency statement available to the members at the meeting, or serves it with every copy of the resolution` AT 29
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78B(4)(b) and s 78C(4)(b) the company makes the solvency statement available at its registered office for inspection free of charge by any creditor` AT 29
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78C(3)(c) the public company lodges a copy of the solvency statement with the Registrar together with the copy of the resolution` AT 43
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78E(1)(d) and (2) the company lodges the documents with the Registrar after the end of 6 weeks and before the end of 8 weeks` AT 84

