§ `ss 78G to 78I: the reduction approved by the Court`

-- Arguments: the company; the company makes an application under s 78G(1); the reduction reduces liability on unpaid share capital; it pays paid-up share capital to a shareholder; the Court so directs; the list of qualifying creditors; the date the order is made; the Registrar allowed a longer period; the last day of the longer period. Day 0 is the day the company applies. The order on day 40 is 10 April 2026.

