    PARTY Court DOES `s 78H(2) the Court settles a list of qualifying creditors` AT 5
    PARTY Court DOES `s 78I(1) the Court makes an order approving the reduction` AT 40
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 78I(3) the company lodges a copy of the order and a notice containing the reduction information` AT 130

