--   line 205: expected FULFILLED, MAIN prints RESIDUAL: No application: the company lodges on day 42, the first day after the 6 weeks.
--   line 210: expected FULFILLED, MAIN prints RESIDUAL: No application: the company lodges on day 55, the last day before the end of the 8 weeks.
--   line 216: expected FULFILLED, MAIN prints RESIDUAL: No application: the company lodges on day 56, after the 8 weeks, so the reduction does not take effect, which is no breach.
--   line 222: expected FULFILLED, MAIN prints RESIDUAL: The company lodges on day 41, the last day of the 6 weeks: not after the end of 6 weeks, so the lodging does not count, none follows, and the reductio
--   line 253: expected FULFILLED, MAIN prints BREACH: An application on day 42 is after the 6 weeks: it is not an application "during the 6 weeks", so the company lodges on day 50 as if none had been made
--   line 313: expected FULFILLED, MAIN prints RESIDUAL: A private company: the statement at the meeting on day 0, kept open to day 41, the documents lodged on day 50.
